Subject: retain the executed origin of man IP register labels
Upstream-Status: Local shim contract

A numeric label may be emitted by a macro whose invocation has unrelated
register arguments. Track the bytes introduced by pre-incremented register
expansion through native buffer rewrites, macro arguments and aliases. Attach
the receipt only when the actual IP label consumes that argument.

